{"type": "tool_use", "timestamp": 1793896797984, "sessionID": "ses_e536b4f86ffe37ao0bfBiAw9Fx", "part": {"type": "tool", "tool": "knowledge_search_docs", "callID": "call_0fbafd363cf446f6aa9cd44e74df6fbe", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"query": "PaymentsService API direct callers take payments", "k": 3}, "output": "[order-service#Integrations]\nOrderService: Integrations\nIt calls the PaymentsAPI to authorize and capture. It depends on UserService to resolve the ordering customer.\n\n[payments-service#Overview]\nPaymentsService: Overview\nPaymentsService exposes the PaymentsAPI. It wraps the external payment provider so that no other service holds provider credentials.\n\n[payments-service#Integrations]\nPaymentsService: Integrations\nIt calls the NotificationsAPI on a declined authorization, so the customer hears about a decline even when checkout has already returned.\n\nPaymentsService is maintained by the same team as BillingService.", "metadata": {"truncated": false}, "title": "", "time": {"start": 1793896795505, "end": 1793896797944}}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "fc_018f0dfb473c2374016aecb15aec4487d18a19ff09c7ffd9b7"}}, "id": "prt_1ac94cd6c0019MzcO3SYVHLhKx", "sessionID": "ses_e536b4f86ffe37ao0bfBiAw9Fx", "messageID": "msg_1ac94b46c001uCybe1Yv7ez4uf"}}
