{"type": "tool_use", "timestamp": 1793896800407, "sessionID": "ses_e536b4f86ffe37ao0bfBiAw9Fx", "part": {"type": "tool", "tool": "knowledge_search_docs", "callID": "call_15ac51e8476e49619afdfeaabf301d1a", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"query": "RenewalsWorker PaymentsAPI renewals payments", "k": 2}, "output": "[renewals-worker#Overview]\nRenewalsWorker: Overview\nRenewalsWorker re-bills subscriptions monthly. It runs as a scheduled job on the first of each month and works through every active subscription.\n\n[renewals-worker#Integrations]\nRenewalsWorker: Integrations\nIt depends on BillingService and calls the PaymentsAPI directly, without going through OrderService, because a renewal has no cart.", "metadata": {"truncated": false}, "title": "", "time": {"start": 1793896800374, "end": 1793896800404}}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "fc_06639ea51690d7ba016aecb16007fc87d1978d380f6d41a6df"}}, "id": "prt_1ac94df64001VATwejf1gg1zfJ", "sessionID": "ses_e536b4f86ffe37ao0bfBiAw9Fx", "messageID": "msg_1ac94d716001iUjzjjrHwstLVa"}}
