{"type": "text", "timestamp": 1793896805221, "sessionID": "ses_e536b4f86ffe37ao0bfBiAw9Fx", "part": {"id": "prt_1ac94ebb200104n9oi24byqWyW", "messageID": "msg_1ac94e0cc001Jd2UyAZpRF3eo5", "sessionID": "ses_e536b4f86ffe37ao0bfBiAw9Fx", "type": "text", "text": "If **PaymentsService** is down, these two direct callers of its **PaymentsAPI** can no longer take payments:\n\n- **OrderService** \u2014 calls PaymentsAPI to authorize and capture order payments. [order-service#Integrations]\n- **RenewalsWorker** \u2014 calls PaymentsAPI directly to re-bill subscriptions monthly, without going through OrderService. [renewals-worker#Overview; renewals-worker#Integrations]\n\n**PaymentsService** exposes **PaymentsAPI**, so both payment flows depend directly on its availability. [payments-service#Overview]", "time": {"start": 1793896803251, "end": 1793896805193}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "msg_0d005fd34b22afde016aecb163221887d1b9fd427413faccd3", "phase": "final_answer"}}}}
